础项目有清单、收费依法制定"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["遗体接运、存放、告别、火化、骨灰寄存、生态安葬，都在国家的基础项目清单里。公办机构提供的骨灰格位安葬也在里面。这些项目的价钱按规定来定，清单之外不许另立项目收钱…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/25-07"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["遇到强制搭售、标价外加价、把一项拆成几项收费，记下来投诉"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["条例点名的价格违法行为有：不挂价目表、在标价之外加钱、捆绑强卖丧葬用品、逼你接受别家的收费服务。把一项拆成几项收费，也算变相涨价。当场先要价目表，留好收费凭据和…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/25-08"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["殡葬代理、用品代购、策划主持这类中介，要在县级民政备案"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["殡葬代理、用品代购、策划主持、信息咨询这类中介，要在县级民政部门备案。没备案的，不进民政部门那套殡葬服务信息系统。能不能自己查各地不一样，最稳的是打电话问县级民…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-text-link","href":"/book/25"},"children":["阅读整个主题：人走了以后要办什么 ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tabbar","aria-label":"主导航"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/book"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"21","height":"21","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-book-open","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 7v14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["全书"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/top-50"},"children":[